WEBVTT

NOTE Version 5 selected-voice illustrated walkthrough; timed to its matching v5 MP4, not the legacy v4 recording.

parent-001
00:00:00.295 --> 00:00:05.862
Welcome, Parent or Guardian, open your
school’s short link, for example,

parent-002
00:00:05.862 --> 00:00:09.187
ndhschoolos dot app, slash s, slash
markaz,

parent-003
00:00:09.187 --> 00:00:12.202
and check its crest, motto and colours.

parent-004
00:00:12.915 --> 00:00:17.180
Use your registered phone number and
privately supplied four-digit PIN, with no

parent-005
00:00:17.180 --> 00:00:20.797
email or password needed, and contact your
school if you need help.

parent-006
00:00:21.718 --> 00:00:26.883
Tap Install school app for the school
crest and name on your home screen, or use

parent-007
00:00:26.883 --> 00:00:29.723
Safari, Share, Add to Home Screen on
iPhone.

parent-008
00:00:30.693 --> 00:00:34.780
Choose from your linked children to check
attendance and school updates, asking the

parent-009
00:00:34.780 --> 00:00:37.439
school to correct any missing or incorrect
child link.

parent-010
00:00:38.466 --> 00:00:43.093
Open published results and the same fixed
A4 report on phone, tablet or computer,

parent-011
00:00:43.093 --> 00:00:46.120
then check the full page and margins
before printing.

parent-012
00:00:47.254 --> 00:00:51.310
Teachers save lesson records offline and
sync automatically on reconnect, so

parent-013
00:00:51.310 --> 00:00:53.712
updates follow sync and school release
rules,

parent-014
00:00:53.712 --> 00:00:55.953
with Tahfeez optional for enabled schools.

parent-015
00:00:56.930 --> 00:01:00.872
Check your child’s fees and official
receipts, remember that new sign-ins,

parent-016
00:01:00.872 --> 00:01:04.600
online payments and messages need
internet, and keep your PIN private.
